<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>
      Your email is verified and your organization application
      <strong>{{applicationCode}}</strong> on <strong>{{appName}}</strong> is saved as a draft.
      You can close the page and come back whenever you have everything ready — for example
      the names and emails of the other owners.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{editUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #0b57d0; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none">Continue your application</a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">{{editUrl}}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666">
      The link stays valid for {{expiresInDays}} days. Keep it private: anyone who has it can
      edit the draft. Lost it? Start again from the application page with the same email —
      you will get back to this draft.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
